&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Axon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axon&#39;s mission is simple and bold: Protect Life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build technology that helps first responders, security teams and communities act with speed, clarity and confidence in the moments that matter most. Our Real-Time Operations (RTO) portfolio, anchored by the Fusus platform, is transforming how law enforcement, enterprise security and international agencies detect, assess and respond to threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fusus connects live video, alerts, sensors and location data into a unified operating picture. Mobile is where that picture meets the field. It&#39;s the phone in an officer&#39;s pocket, the screen in a patrol car, the device a security lead carries across a campus. We&#39;re building fast, dependable mobile experiences that put the right information in responders&#39; hands wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Product Manager for Fusus Mobile, you will define and lead the strategy and roadmap for how Fusus works on the move. Your goal is to make mobile a first-class surface of real-time operations, not a smaller copy of the web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the Fusus mobile platform and its primary apps: the experiences officers, supervisors and security teams use to receive alerts, view livestreams, see who is nearby and coordinate response. You&#39;ll also own the foundations other Axon teams build on, so new capabilities reach mobile at the same time as web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead our boldest bets on mobile: personalised, role-based experiences that adapt to each user, AI-assisted workflows in the field, and new form factors such as in-vehicle (CarPlay and Android Auto), tablets and wearables. Your work will help responders around the world act faster and stay safer, and directly advance Axon&#39;s mission to Protect Life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This role is based out of our London office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Fusus Mobile product strategy and roadmap across iOS and Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the mobile platform (shared components, navigation, notifications, identity) that lets other teams ship features on mobile alongside web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead personalised and role-based mobile experiences, using mobile as the proving ground before they move to web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the gap between mobile and web for core workflows such as alerts, livestreaming, maps and search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the apps dependable in the field: offline behaviour, poor connectivity, battery, background location and push&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering (UK, U.S. and Romania) and design to plan, release and monitor mobile versions on a predictable cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage law enforcement and enterprise users in the field (ride-alongs, site visits, betas) to validate needs and test improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use metrics and feedback to set priorities: daily active use, crash-free sessions, time from alert to action, app store ratings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support go-to-market, training, enablement and rollout with Customer Success, Professional Services and Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responders reach for Fusus Mobile first because it is fast, reliable and built for how they work in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New Fusus capabilities launch on mobile at the same time as web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalised experiences help each user see what matters to their role, with less setup and less noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption grows across customer segments with high daily use, strong retention and positive field feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–10 years of product management experience, including 3+ years owning native mobile products (iOS and Android)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products where speed, clarity and reliability directly affect outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of mobile platform concepts: release management and app stores, push notifications, background location, offline sync, device and OS fragmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with real-time data, live video, maps and geolocation, alerting, or IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of turning field and user insight into clear product direction and focused execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead cross-functional and distributed teams through roadmap, design, delivery and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who drives alignment, decisions and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in public safety, security, logistics, field service or other mission-critical domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with personalisation, in-vehicle (CarPlay / Android Auto) or wearable experiences, or AI-assisted mobile workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a mobile platform or SDK used by other product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Axon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of how responders and security teams work in the field, creating safer outcomes for communities and organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a mission-driven company with a history of innovation and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside passionate teams building technology that protects lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary and RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with matching contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance and cash plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days paid holiday plus UK public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GymPass subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth, learning support, and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
